title: National Day of Catalonia
view-if: year = 2013 and month = 9 and not rubicon
tags: event
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: diada2013_response = null
set-bg: img/diada/2010.jpg
face-image: img/diada/2013.jpg
role: event

= The Catalan Way

Following the example of the Baltics in '89, the ANC is organizing a human chain 400-km long for this year's National Day of Catalonia, stretching from Le Perthus in the French border down to Vinaròs, already in Valencia. 

- @join
- @force
- @pass

@join
title: Join the demonstration!
choose-if: player_roadmap > 0 and not broken_roadmap and (not ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or independence_trust >= 40)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap <= 0: We have no Roadmap to Independence. ?][? if broken_roadmap: Given our broken promises, we are unwelcome here. ?][? if ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and independence_trust < 40: The organization's lack of trust in our action in government makes us unwelcome here.  ?]
on-arrival: diada2013_response = "join"
go-to: report

@force
title: We'll join, and help out organizing so that it is a success!
subtitle: Our party apparatus will mobilize in force for this. \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: player_roadmap > 0 and not broken_roadmap and (not ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or independence_trust >= 40) and party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap <= 0: We have no Roadmap to Independence. ?][? if broken_roadmap: Given our broken promises, we are unwelcome here. ?][? if ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and independence_trust < 40:  The organization's lack of trust in our action in government makes us unwelcome here. ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: diada2013_response = "force"
go-to: report

@pass
title: Stay on the sidelines
on-arrival: diada2013_response = "pass"
go-to: report

@report
on-arrival: {!
    var response = Q.diada2013_response;
    var option = this.game.scenes['2013diada.' + response];
    // Check participation before the demonstration's own trust increase.
    if (Q.year == 2013 && Q.month == 9 && !Q.rubicon && option &&
        this._runPredicate(option.chooseIf, true)) {
        // Diada 2013 — Via Catalana, 400km human chain. Movement consolidating.
        // Effect AND street turnout decided dynamically from current state (existing Q
        // vars only). Model + rationale: simulations/diada_dynamics.py.
        var IM = Q.independence_movement, IT = Q.independence_trust;
        Q.diada2013_trust = IT;
        var SD = Q.social_dissent, CSR = Q.cat_spa_relations;
        var pod = Q.podemos_channeling || 0;
        var clamp = function (x, lo, hi) { return Math.max(lo, Math.min(hi, x)); };

        // Situational reads (existing bool flags; absent => false). A referendum/consulta
        // IS street action (mobilises); a caretaker government means an ordinary election
        // is near, which drains the marginal effect to the ballot — but still draws crowds.
        var mobilise = (Q.referendum_pending || Q.consultation_pending) ? 1 : 0;
        var channel  = Q.cat_caretaker_gov ? 1 : 0;

        // Magnitude: autonomous street floor (IM-IT gap, widest when parties haven't earned
        // trust) + mobilisation, amplified by antagonism, drained by an imminent election.
        var gap   = Math.max(0, IM - IT);
        var antag = clamp(1 + 0.5 * (40 - CSR) / 40, 0.4, 1.6);
        var mag   = clamp((1.5 + 0.18 * gap + 5.0 * mobilise) * antag * (1 - 0.45 * channel), 0, 16);

        // Valence: hope by default; grief (the sign flips) in the repression aftermath —
        // broken roadmap + relations on the floor + anger (dissent) still unspent.
        var grief = 0;
        if (Q.broken_roadmap) {
            grief = clamp((20 - CSR) / 15, 0, 1) * clamp((SD - 48) / 10, 0, 1);
        }
        var valence = 1 - 2 * grief;

        // Political effect (post_event clamps each variable afterwards).
        Q.independence_movement += mag * valence;
        Q.independence_trust    += 0.22 * mag * valence;
        Q.social_dissent        += -0.22 * mag * valence * (1 - 0.6 * pod);
        Q.cat_spa_relations     += -0.30 * mag;

        // Street turnout for flavour text, in millions of participants (display only).
        // The Via Catalana's organizational capacity anchors the estimate; current
        // movement strength, unmet demand, antagonism, and looming votes adjust it.
        var turnoutAnchor = 1.45;
        var stateAdjustment = clamp(
            0.008 * (IM - 60) + 0.006 * (gap - 25) + 0.004 * (40 - CSR),
            -0.35, 0.35
        );
        var voteBoost = 0.20 * mobilise + 0.05 * channel;
        Q.diada_size = clamp((turnoutAnchor + stateAdjustment + voteBoost) * (1 - 0.40 * grief), 0.2, 2.0);
        Q.diada_size = Math.round(Q.diada_size * 100) / 100;
        // Party participation adds to the autonomous mobilization above.
        if (response == "join" || response == "force") {
            var inGovernment = (Q.player_party == "erc" && Q.erc_in_gob) ||
                (Q.player_party == "cup" && Q.cup_in_gob) ||
                (Q.player_in_jxsi && Q.jxsi_in_gob) || (Q.player_in_jxcat && Q.jxcat_in_gob);
            var inForce = response == "force";
            if (inForce) Q.party_resources -= 1;
            Q.independence_movement += inForce ? 3 : 1;
            Q.cat_spa_relations -= inForce ? 5 : 1;
            if (inForce && inGovernment) Q.independence_trust += 3;
            Q.diada_size = Math.round(clamp(Q.diada_size * (inForce ? 1.10 : 1.05), 0.2, 2.0) * 100) / 100;
        }
    }
!}

[? if diada_size >= 1.2: The completed chain, made possible by the participation of?][? if diada_size < 1.2: The incompleted chain, which saw the participation of?] [+ diada_size +] million people, stretched from Le Perthus in the French border down to Vinaròs, already in Valencia, following the whole length of the Catalan coast. 

The protest was supported by [? if (diada2013_trust >= 40 or not (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob)) and parlament_current_ciu == "ciu": cdc, but not udc, ?][? if (diada2013_trust >= 40 or not (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob)) and parlament_current_ciu != "ciu": [+ parlament_current_ciu +], ?][? if ((player_party != "cup" or diada2013_response != "pass") and (diada2013_trust >= 40 or not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): the CUP, ?][? if ((player_party != "erc" or diada2013_response != "pass") and (diada2013_trust >= 40 or not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): ERC, ?][? if (diada2013_trust >= 40 or not (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob)) or ((player_party != "cup" or diada2013_response != "pass") and (diada2013_trust >= 40 or not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))) or ((player_party != "erc" or diada2013_response != "pass") and (diada2013_trust >= 40 or not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): and ?]many other minor parties and organizations. This time, however, ICV-EUiA has kept out of it. [? if parlament_current_ciu != "ciu": So has, unsurprisingly, ucd. ?]
[? if diada2013_trust < 40 and ((cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob) or (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))): The organizers made it clear that representatives of [? if (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob): [+ parlament_current_ciu +][? if (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)):,?] [? if ((erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))) or ((cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))): and ?]?][? if (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): ERC [? if (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): and ?]?][? if (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): the CUP ?]were not welcome, given the lack of commitment to independence while in government. ?]

- @post_event
